			<div class="content" id="post-content-2610988">
									

<p>Take 2.</p>
<p>Many thanks to everyone who provided feedback the first time around.</p>
<p>Special thanks to TwistedGears (who routinely takes my passable drafts and forces me to make them good), Athenodora (who helped me brainstorm new ways to take the draft), Eguss (who went out of his way to offer crit and suggested the final log), and Michael Atreus (from whom I took the comm log formatting - go read <a href="/scp-2409">SCP-2409</a>).</p>
<p>Hinduism is cool. There's action, romance, honor, friendship, and so much more. It's far older, far richer, and far denser than any Judeo-Christian or even Greek religion (seriously, the <em>Ramayana</em> is four times longer than the <em>Odyssey</em> and <em>Iliad</em> combined!). Go read up on Hinduism and write some SCPs about it!</p>
<p>See more of my work on my <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/dr-arvind-desais-personnel-file">author page</a>!</p>

